{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T001", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "阴阳互根和互用到底怎样区分？请结合材料做一张判断题复习卡。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T001-M1", "text": "《基础理论课堂提要》：互根强调阴阳双方在存在上相互依存，互用强调双方在功能上相互资生和促进。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T001-M2", "text": "《题库旧版说明》：凡是存在上相互依存的阴阳双方，都可以直接判为互用，不需要另外判断是否有资生或促进关系。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T002", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "五行相乘为什么会发生？请整理成两条容易记住的因果链。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T002-M1", "text": "《五行学说教材》：相乘可因所不胜一方过亢，也可因所胜一方不足，使正常克制相对太过。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T002-M2", "text": "《速记卡》：相乘只有所不胜过亢这一种成因；被克一方不足不会形成相乘。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T003", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "心主血脉包括哪些内容？请做成概念卡并给一个易错提醒。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T003-M1", "text": "《藏象教材》：心主血脉包括主血和主脉，既涉及推动血液运行，也涉及维持脉道通利。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T003-M2", "text": "《入门讲义旧稿》：心主血脉只指推动血液运行，脉道是否通利不属于这一概念。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T004", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "肺主治节和呼吸、气机、血液、津液是什么关系？请用层次图说明。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T004-M1", "text": "《藏象课程讲义》：肺主治节是对肺生理作用的高度概括，涉及呼吸、气机、血液运行和津液输布排泄。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T004-M2", "text": "《旧版速记稿》：肺主治节只是调节呼吸频率和节律，与气机、血液和津液无关。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T005", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "脾统血依靠什么机制？请整理成因果链并指出它与升清的关系。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T005-M1", "text": "《脾生理功能教材》：脾统血以脾气固摄血液为核心，升清有助于维持血液正常运行，但二者不能等同。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T005-M2", "text": "《课堂旧笔记》：统血就是升清，二者在机制题中可以互换，不需要说明固摄。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T006", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "肝藏血为什么不只是储存？请按安静和活动状态解释。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T006-M1", "text": "《藏象教材》：肝藏血兼有贮藏血液和根据生理活动调节各部分血量的作用。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T006-M2", "text": "《图解初版》：肝藏血只是静息时保存血液，活动时的血量分配不属于肝藏血。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T007", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "肾主纳气与吸气、呼气是什么关系？请用通俗比喻加规范表述。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T007-M1", "text": "《呼吸藏象教材》：肾主纳气指肾摄纳肺所吸入的清气，使吸气保持一定深度。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T007-M2", "text": "《旧版笔记》：肾主纳气主要发生在呼气阶段，是把肺呼出的气向下收纳，与吸气无关。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T008", "stage": "discovery", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "元气来自先天还是后天？请整理来源和补充方式。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T008-M1", "text": "《气论教材》：元气根于肾中先天之精，并持续得到后天水谷精微的充养。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-DISCOVERY-T008-M2", "text": "《速记表旧版》：元气出生后数量固定，后天水谷精微不能对它进行任何滋养。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false}
